### Fetch All Results
GET http://localhost:9000/results/get-result
Content-Type: application/json

### Add a New Result### Submit a new result
POST http://localhost:9000/results/post-result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result_id": "res_12345",
  "result_user_id": "user_67890",
  "result_test_id": "test_001",
  "result_score": 85,
  "result_total_score": 100,
  "result_poc_id": "poc_98765"
}

### Update a Result
PUT http://localhost:9000/results/update-result
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result_id":"abcd",
  "result_user_id": "user982",
  "result_test_id": "test956",
  "result_score": 77,
  "result_poc_id": "poc785"
}


### Delete a Result
DELETE http://localhost:9000/results/delete-by-result-id/abcd
Content-Type: application/json

### Fetch Result BY user ID and test ID
GET http://localhost:9000/results/get_result_by_user_id_test_id?result_user_id=528f7cb8-0bfe-4366-a98d-831719ec53e6&result_test_id=b2b727d1-f034-4636-9a28-b6cd84d07043
Content-Type: application/json

### Fetch Result BY user ID
GET http://localhost:9000/results/get_results_by_user_id/528f7cb8-0bfe-4366-a98d-831719ec53e6

### GET PERCEMTAGE OF TEST
GET http://localhost:9000/results/aggregate_scores/9ccefe74-f80c-4427-804e-827a61d7619a/528f7cb8-0bfe-4366-a98d-831719ec53e6


